UUID: 4c359a32-7693-3e32-a710-c61c9acaef79
Estimation of electricity and fuel use for the production steps. No raw materials and transports of raw materials to the plant included. Infrastructure of the production plant not included.
Location: Data used has no specific geographical origin (literature values).
Technology: Approximation from data of polyester yarn prodcuction. No raw material included.
Time period: Time of literature publication.
Production volume: na
Sampling: Data from Literature used 
Extrapolations: none
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_4c359a32-7693-3e32-a710-c61c9acaef79.xml</text>
